     · 8. Temporary 5xx/network failure: retries transient errors and succeeds u
pon retry
     · 9. Daily quota exhaustion: detects RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED, immediately aborts
 retries and uses fallback
     · 10. Client / Auth error (400, 404): halts retries immediately without was
teful attempts
     · 11. Malformed AI response: fails validation, uses fallback and does not p
ollute cache
     · 12. Cache eviction: bounded LRU cache evicts oldest entry when max capaci
ty is reached
